That's unbelievable.

257
00:16:01,290 --> 00:16:02,960
And yet believable.

258
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:05,710
So I decided not to fire her again...

259
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:09,300
...until I'm sure she will be of no threat to herself or others.

260
00:16:10,170 --> 00:16:14,970
I see. Hmm. You never really know what's going on inside a person's head.

261
00:16:15,050 --> 00:16:18,640
Well, I guess that's why they call it psychology, sir.

262
00:16:24,690 --> 00:16:27,940
For this, after all, is the miracle of birth.

263
00:16:28,190 --> 00:16:29,480
Lights, please.

264
00:16:29,730 --> 00:16:31,190
And that's having a baby.

265
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:33,650
Next week is our final class.

266
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,780
Susan, go deep.

267
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:44,080
It's impossible. It's just impossible.

268
00:16:44,290 --> 00:16:45,370
