269
00:16:45,620 --> 00:16:47,460
What that woman...

270
00:16:47,670 --> 00:16:48,710
...did.

271
00:16:49,750 --> 00:16:52,420
I am not doing that. Heh.

272
00:16:52,670 --> 00:16:55,800
It'll have to stay in, that's all. Everything will be the same.

273
00:16:56,050 --> 00:16:59,050
- It'll just stay in. Ha, ha.     - Carol, honey. Shh.

274
00:16:59,260 --> 00:17:01,930
- Everything will be all right.     - What do you know?

275
00:17:02,140 --> 00:17:04,980
No one's saying to you, "Hi, is that your nostril?

276
00:17:05,230 --> 00:17:07,730
Mind if we push this pot roast through it?"

277
00:17:08,980 --> 00:17:10,570
Carol, sweetie.

278
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:12,230
Cleansing breath.

279
00:17:13,570 --> 00:17:16,650
I know it's frightening. But big picture:

280
00:17:16,910 --> 00:17:19,280
The birth part is just one day...

281
00:17:19,700 --> 00:17:23,870
...and when it's over, we'll all be parents for the rest of our lives.

282
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:27,040
I mean, that's what this is all about, right?

283
00:17:27,290 --> 00:17:28,330
Ross?

284
00:17:29,460 --> 00:17:30,500
Ross.

285
00:17:31,300 --> 00:17:33,250
I'm gonna be a father.

286
00:17:34,420 --> 00:17:37,720
