287
00:17:37,930 --> 00:17:41,220
I just never realized the baby was having me.

288
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,560
Oh, you're gonna be great.

289
00:17:43,810 --> 00:17:45,180
How could you say that?

290
00:17:45,390 --> 00:17:48,520
I can't even get Marcel to stop eating the bathmat.

291
00:17:49,230 --> 00:17:50,610
How will I raise a kid?

292
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:53,360
You know, Ross, some scientists are now saying...

293
00:17:53,610 --> 00:17:56,650
...that monkeys and babies are actually different.

294
00:18:00,030 --> 00:18:01,240
- Where are you going?     - Out.

295
00:18:01,490 --> 00:18:02,910
With?

296
00:18:03,290 --> 00:18:04,370
Yes.

297
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:07,290
