298
00:18:08,290 --> 00:18:11,250
Have you two, you know, like, you know?

299
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:13,960
You know?

300
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,960
Yet?

301
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:18,800
Well, not that it's any of your business...

302
00:18:19,050 --> 00:18:20,760
...but no, we haven't, okay?

303
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:28,560
