304
00:18:37,070 --> 00:18:39,860
- Do you have a sec?     - Uh, sure, Nina. What's up?

305
00:18:40,450 --> 00:18:43,660
I don't know. For the past couple days, people have been avoiding me...

306
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:45,830
