313
00:19:05,850 --> 00:19:08,810
Oh, my God. You're amazing.

314
00:19:09,390 --> 00:19:11,310
Oh, you don't know.

315
00:19:12,190 --> 00:19:15,610
Helen, make sure we put through the paperwork on Miss Bookbinder's raise.

316
00:19:16,150 --> 00:19:19,900
Still want her psychological profile sent to personnel?

317
00:19:20,070 --> 00:19:22,990
- What?     - Helen drinks.

318
