352
00:21:17,190 --> 00:21:19,190
Oh, please. They've been going out a week.

353
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:23,730
They haven't even slept together yet. I mean, that's not serious.

354
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:28,240
Okay.

355
00:21:30,080 --> 00:21:31,700
Oh. Okay. Oh.

356
00:21:47,930 --> 00:21:48,970
Oh.

357
00:21:49,850 --> 00:21:52,720
Yeah, um, may we help you?

